  "description": "YITAMOTOR Toyota Camry chrome housing clear lens. A high-grade clear lens offers better visibility. As a much brighter alternative to dim, yellow headlights. A sharper, more focused beam ensures a pleasurable driving experience.\nFitment\n2012- 2014 Toyota Camry L/LE/XLE\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility – Headlight assembly compatible with 2012-2014 Camry L/LE/XLE/Hybrid LE/Hybrid XLE ; Not fit SE/SE Sport/Hybrid SE. High beam mode HB3; low beam mode H11; bulbs and wiring harness not Included\nWaterproof– Fully sealed with solid silicone and equipped with one-way pressure-equalizing vents. This design resists moisture buildup and condensation inside the housing, so your headlights stay clear and functional in rain, snow, and humid conditions\nEnhanced Brightness – The metallic parabolic reflectors optimize light output, delivering a broader, smoother, and more focused beam. Experience enhanced nighttime visibility and reduced eye strain for safer driving\nSide Safety Reflector – Built-in micro-prism reflectors on the sides make your vehicle highly visible to oncoming traffic and pedestrians at night. This passive safety feature ensures you are seen from all angles, reducing collision risks at intersections\nDirect Bolt-On Replacement – Professional installation recommended. Comes as a complete pair including driver (left) and passenger (right) sides",
